msgid "Migration announcement email"
msgstr "마이그레이션 안내 이메일"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 "
"<https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:7
msgid ""
"To notify your end users of your migration to Mattermost, we created a "
"sample email template that you can use."
msgstr ""
"최종 사용자에게 OKR.BEST로의 마이그레이션을 알릴 수 있도록 사용할 수 있는 샘플 이메일 템플릿을 "
"만들었습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:9
msgid "Remember to replace all the items in bold with your information."
msgstr "굵게 표시된 모든 항목을 사용자 정보로 바꾸어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:12
msgid "Email template"
msgstr "이메일 템플릿"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:14
msgid "To: End users"
msgstr "받는 사람: 최종 사용자"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:16
msgid "Subject: Moving to Mattermost"
msgstr "제목: OKR.BEST로 이동"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:19
msgid "Hi all,"
msgstr "안녕하세요,"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:21
msgid ""
"As some of you already know, we are moving from **[System]** to "
"Mattermost as our collaboration platform. We have imported our existing "
"users and data into Mattermost so we can continue to communicate, share "
"files and collaborate."
msgstr ""
"이미 알고 계신 분도 있겠지만, 협업 플랫폼을 **[System]**\\ 에서 OKR.BEST로 이전하고 있습니다. 계속해서 "
"커뮤니케이션하고 파일을 공유하며 협업할 수 있도록 기존 사용자와 데이터를 OKR.BEST로 가져왔습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:23
msgid "To get started:"
msgstr "시작하려면:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:25
msgid ""
"Open a browser on your computer, go to **[Mattermost URL]** and select “I"
" forgot my password” to set your new password for Mattermost using the "
"email address you used on the previous system."
msgstr ""
"컴퓨터에서 브라우저를 열고 **[Mattermost URL]**\\ 로 이동한 다음 “비밀번호를 잊어버렸습니다”를 선택하여 "
"이전 시스템에서 사용한 이메일 주소로 OKR.BEST의 새 비밀번호를 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:27
msgid "Once you reset your password, use your email and new password to log in."
msgstr "비밀번호를 재설정한 후 이메일과 새 비밀번호를 사용해 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:29
msgid ""
"`Download <https://mattermost.com/apps>`__ the Mattermost apps for "
"desktop and mobile. Refer to the :doc:`Use Mattermost </end-user-guide"
"/end-user-guide-index>` end user documentation on how to get up and "
"running quickly."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 및 모바일용 Mattermost 앱을 `다운로드 <https://mattermost.com/apps>`__\\ 합니다. 빠르게 "
"시작하는 방법은 최종 사용자 문서 :doc:`OKR.BEST 사용 </end-user-guide/end-user-guide-index>`을 "
"참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:31
msgid "Remember to bookmark the URL so you can use it to log in next time!"
msgstr "다음에 로그인할 때 사용할 수 있도록 URL을 북마크해 두세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:33
msgid "Questions?"
msgstr "질문이 있나요?"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:35
msgid ""
"If you have any questions, feel free to post in the **[~Mattermost "
"channel]** or email us at **[Support email]**."
msgstr ""
"질문이 있으면 **[~Mattermost channel]**\\ 에 글을 게시하거나 **[Support email]**\\ 로 이메일을 "
"보내주세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:37
msgid "Happy collaborating!"
msgstr "즐겁게 협업하세요!"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email.rst:39
msgid "**[Sign-off]**"
msgstr "**[Sign-off]**"
